  _lines:
  - You refused to harm your Manager no matter how wrong she did you.
  - I can only assume it was because you realized her usefulness to you here, correct?
  - Every Company has its uses for incompetence. Middle Management requires it!
  - But her use is ending. I see a new opportunity for growth.
